							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13976#msg13976"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13976#msg13976">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 12:01:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							We are snagging pretty much every priest leveling up on Medivh atm. It&#039;s like AoD and bards back when you didn&#039;t have unlimited numbers of every class in EQ.
