								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13977#msg13977">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 12:43:31 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13976#msg13976">Quote from: Delheru on January 27, 2005, 12:01:40 pm</a></div><div class="quote">We are snagging pretty much every priest leveling up on Medivh atm. It&#039;s like AoD and bards back when you didn&#039;t have unlimited numbers of every class in EQ.<br /></div><br />Well, that is kinda the difference between us Del, I&#039;m not&nbsp; overly pushing for, nor are the members of the guild pushing to create a major raiding guild, at least not now. That might change once we&#039;ve worked through all the rest of the content, but overall, many of us are simply happy to move through the content at our own pace, and enjoy the travel for now. <br /><br />Never know how the games going to change in the next 6 months or so as they ad more PvP stuff, and more instances.
						</td>
					</tr>
