								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13982#msg13982">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #19 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 01:45:57 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							OMG I am in shock!!&nbsp; Ascent cannot break up! Where is everyone going to go? Ascent was a great guild it will be missed!!<br /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness
