	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13986"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=888" title="View the profile of RN_Jooseeph">RN_Jooseeph</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 28<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m your huckleberry...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=888"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13986#msg13986"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13986#msg13986">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #20 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 02:33:18 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Sad to see Ascent go.  When I first started EQ, it was pointed out to me that Ascent was the top guild on the server.  I use to do a /who all Ascent just to see what jumble of letters they were all raiding that day.  When Velious came out, I logged on only to see what new zone they were hitting.  It upsets me that RN will lose so many skilled players, and some I consider good friends, with the xfers and acct selling.  Hate to see it happen but I hope those of you that will be leaving will rekindle the joy you once felt playing EQ in whatever you decide to move onto.  GL in life and be safe.<br /><br />Joe.  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img145.exs.cx/img145/342/signature3yu.gif" alt="" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
