								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13987#msg13987">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #21 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 02:41:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
