							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Wow... Ascent was formed right after I started EQ...&nbsp; Gonna be wierd not seeing that tag around.&nbsp; Hope some of the good ones come to Conviction.<br /><br />/salute
