						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14005#msg14005"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14005#msg14005">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 08:10:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
