								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14012#msg14012">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> January 28, 2005, 01:39:49 am &#187;</span></td>
