							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14002#msg14002">Quote from: Delheru on January 27, 2005, 07:16:24 pm</a></div><div class="quote">As for Kinladars comment... Ascent just is a raiding guild. We&#039;re defined by the fact that we do the high end content. We have too many people who get bored to tears without that element to the game, and adding people like Dyvim to the old core just made that so much more acute. If we do not do the higher end content, there is no reason for us to play.<br /></div><br />Nah, wasn&#039;t meaning anything as a negative, just as a statment of fact. We&#039;re not interested in just getting to the raiding part really yet. It&#039;s a cool game, with alot to explore, and alot of these peeps never got to see it in beta.<br /><br />Eventually we will, but it&#039;s been really cool just to chill the last few weeks, and just enjoy something again.
						</td>
